{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choo-choo! Train Valley Origins welcomes you to a world of charming locomotives, intricate track layouts, and brain-teasing challenges. \ud83d\udee4\ufe0f\ud83d\ude82\ud83d\ude84\u2764\ufe0f Maintain traffic flow through increasingly complex levels, managing switches, optimizing railway networks, and ensuring your cargo reaches its destination on time, avoiding collisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/d48032fce12dd2d916b9291e10db56cd.poster.avif?t=1754315476\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/d48032fce12dd2d916b9291e10db56cd.webm?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/d48032fce12dd2d916b9291e10db56cd.mp4?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features four historical periods and locations from the Wild West to China and Norway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/1554faaa4868ed757aabab04b8c0af42.poster.avif?t=1754315476\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/1554faaa4868ed757aabab04b8c0af42.webm?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/1554faaa4868ed757aabab04b8c0af42.mp4?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various locomotives, from steam engines to modern trains, as you play. Complete your collection and view it in the Shed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/61b0c9e3e7c6f9224dc077aed916a64a.poster.avif?t=1754315476\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/61b0c9e3e7c6f9224dc077aed916a64a.webm?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/61b0c9e3e7c6f9224dc077aed916a64a.mp4?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level presenting a unique puzzle to solve, Train Valley offers a rewarding experience for players who love to think strategically and optimize for maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/86073e933c8ef81b893337de7a3db7ea.poster.avif?t=1754315476\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/86073e933c8ef81b893337de7a3db7ea.webm?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/86073e933c8ef81b893337de7a3db7ea.mp4?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Valley Origins captures the charm and challenge of the original game while adding exciting new features and vibrant, elegant graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/10713c49012c4fdc2b36e64a1ad69ea8.poster.avif?t=1754315476\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/10713c49012c4fdc2b36e64a1ad69ea8.webm?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/10713c49012c4fdc2b36e64a1ad69ea8.mp4?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The built-in level editor is arriving in our first major update. Easy to use - start building your own puzzles in no time, and with Workshop support - share your creations with other players and download even more designs to try out.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Demolition specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451440/ea276172dc3f760bf9e94752440eaa45456911fc.jpg"},{"name":"Demolition expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451440/0ff5e8f47003433c690344238646e97702993cc1.jpg"},{"name":"First time here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451440/fe565b04b21ec4608bf7fd01cacb8af264c79451.jpg"},{"name":"Station Agent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451440/6c5ec50159d537eb2b948e980f7965cba55cbd8f.jpg"},{"name":"Switchman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451440/03b6da4c7d9ddb5f20ae28d8ca791d6e50dd6c77.jpg"},{"name":"Yardmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451440/b5f3a9431815ba0682e678b72a448792ddacbc15.jpg"},{"name":"Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451440/17376329295fd1ac2dea6741d61c2831c8e1f057.jpg"},{"name":"Achiever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451440/079ccf5af3d12193f19f3a7936f4f588d4dfeecd.jpg"},{"name":"Proactive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451440/0e84744751e73b1e70f58f156d2bac9ed123e633.jpg"},{"name":"Ambitious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3451440/8208595180c5f0808344d04edec840184aa3fe25.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451440?t=1754315476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754315476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/f1e97ba2f1e11acee9111eadb06d841247df6511/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754315476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/f1e97ba2f1e11acee9111eadb06d841247df6511/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754315476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choo-choo! Train Valley Origins welcomes you to a world of charming locomotives, intricate track layouts, and brain-teasing challenges. \ud83d\udee4\ufe0f\ud83d\ude82\ud83d\ude84\u2764\ufe0f Maintain traffic flow through increasingly complex levels, managing switches, optimizing railway networks, and ensuring your cargo reaches its destination on time, avoiding collisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/d48032fce12dd2d916b9291e10db56cd.poster.avif?t=1754315476\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/d48032fce12dd2d916b9291e10db56cd.webm?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/d48032fce12dd2d916b9291e10db56cd.mp4?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features four historical periods and locations from the Wild West to China and Norway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/1554faaa4868ed757aabab04b8c0af42.poster.avif?t=1754315476\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/1554faaa4868ed757aabab04b8c0af42.webm?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/1554faaa4868ed757aabab04b8c0af42.mp4?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various locomotives, from steam engines to modern trains, as you play. Complete your collection and view it in the Shed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/61b0c9e3e7c6f9224dc077aed916a64a.poster.avif?t=1754315476\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/61b0c9e3e7c6f9224dc077aed916a64a.webm?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/61b0c9e3e7c6f9224dc077aed916a64a.mp4?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level presenting a unique puzzle to solve, Train Valley offers a rewarding experience for players who love to think strategically and optimize for maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/86073e933c8ef81b893337de7a3db7ea.poster.avif?t=1754315476\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/86073e933c8ef81b893337de7a3db7ea.webm?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/86073e933c8ef81b893337de7a3db7ea.mp4?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Valley Origins captures the charm and challenge of the original game while adding exciting new features and vibrant, elegant graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/10713c49012c4fdc2b36e64a1ad69ea8.poster.avif?t=1754315476\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/10713c49012c4fdc2b36e64a1ad69ea8.webm?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451440/extras/10713c49012c4fdc2b36e64a1ad69ea8.mp4?t=1754315476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The built-in level editor is arriving in our first major update. Easy to use - start building your own puzzles in no time, and with Workshop support - share your creations with other players and download even more designs to try out.</p>","developers":["Flazm"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st